{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Chronomancer: Time Loop keeps Chromatic Shard cooldown synced and procs Aeon Rend (#13614)",
  "contract": [
    "Issue #13614 reports two defects during Pure Chaos Time Loop (807571 -> 807989 -> owned Chromatic Shard 567544):",
    "(1) Chromatic Shard no longer gets its cooldown reduced by Infinite Power (92118) until manually cast again,",
    "and (2) Aeon Rend (583248) does not proc during Time Loop.",
    "Root cause 1: Time Loop casts 567544 with TRIGGERED_FULL_MASK (skipping server cooldown), but Spell::SendSpellGo",
    "omits CAST_FLAG_PENDING because Chromatic Shard has a 3500 ms base cast time, so the client starts a fake 30 s",
    "category-888 cooldown on every Time Loop tick while the server holds 0 s (or a shorter remaining cooldown), making",
    "Infinite Power unable to shrink the desynced client timer. Time Loop now sends SMSG_CLEAR_COOLDOWN and re-sends",
    "SMSG_SPELL_COOLDOWN with the server remaining cooldown if any (and Aeon Rend Restrike clears the client cooldown",
    "when no server cooldown is active).",
    "Root cause 2: Time Loop cast 567544 with TRIGGERED_DISALLOW_PROC_EVENTS and Aeon Rend 583248 lacked",
    "PROC_ATTR_TRIGGERED_CAN_PROC (AttributesMask 2), blocking Aeon Rend on Time Loop shards despite live CoA logs",
    "(2026-08-15-11.24.03) proving restrikes occur during Time Loop. Stripping TRIGGERED_DISALLOW_PROC_EVENTS from",
    "Time Loop and adding AttributesMask 2 to 583248 enables Aeon Rend during Time Loop without chain-proccing.",
    "Phase 1A verifies ready Shard stays client-ready across Time Loop; Phase 1B verifies cooling Shard receives",
    "SMSG_SPELL_COOLDOWN with the true remaining delay and shrinks from Infinite Power; Phase 2 runs 14 Time Loop",
    "windows (42 shards, (0.75)^42 < 5.7e-6) and verifies Aeon Rend procs with owned rank 9 and leaves Shard ready."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 150000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "chronomancer",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 22,
      "level": 80,
      "spell_hit_rating": 10000,
      "spell_crit_rating": 10000
    }
  ],
